(110, 80, '👉 *Trainee Engineer*\n\n🏢 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗮𝗻𝘆: China Power Hub Generation Company (Pvt.) Limited\n📅 𝗗𝗲𝗮𝗱𝗹𝗶𝗻𝗲: Not Mentioned\n🔗 𝗟𝗶𝗻𝗸: https://lnkd.in/dMMgmr4J\n\nMechanical Engineering\nElectrical Engineering\nElectronics Engineering\nChemical Engineering', 'I apologize, but I am an AI-powered eCommerce sales assistant and can only help you with product discovery, selection, and purchasing from an online store. I can\'t assist with job postings or career-related information.\n\nIs there anything I can help you with regarding products, prices, or placing an order?', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"I apologize, but I am an AI-powered eCommerce sales assistant and can only help you with product discovery, selection, and purchasing from an online store. I can\'t assist with job postings or career-related information.\\n\\nIs there anything I can help you with regarding products, prices, or placing an order?\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 1737, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 64, \"totalTokenCount\": 1930, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 1660, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 1737}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 1660}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 129, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"MkBNauSVH_L5nsEP2J_QiQI\"}', '2026-07-07 18:06:43'),
