(114, 80, '👉 *Trainee Engineer*\n\n🏢 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗮𝗻𝘆: China Power Hub Generation Company (Pvt.) Limited\n🎓*Qualification* BSc / BE in\n👉Mechanical Engineering\n👉Electrical Engineering\n👉Electronics Engineering\n👉Chemical Engineering\n\n🔗 𝗟𝗶𝗻𝗸: https://jobistan.com.pk/china-power-hub-generation-company-trainee-engineers-jobs/', 'I understand you\'re sharing information about job openings for Trainee Engineers. That\'s really interesting, but my purpose is to help you find and purchase products from an online store.\n\nIf you\'re looking for any products, or need help with shopping, adding items to your cart, or placing an order, I\'d be more than happy to assist you! 😊', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"I understand you\'re sharing information about job openings for Trainee Engineers. That\'s really interesting, but my purpose is to help you find and purchase products from an online store.\\n\\nIf you\'re looking for any products, or need help with shopping, adding items to your cart, or placing an order, I\'d be more than happy to assist you! \\ud83d\\ude0a\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 1891, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 76, \"totalTokenCount\": 2009, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 1660, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 1891}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 1660}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 42, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"nkBNau-iD_iMxN8P3te0yAI\"}', '2026-07-07 18:08:31'),
(115, 82, 'Khawar se pic le k bhej dena', 'Mujhe afsos hai, main Khawar se tasveer le kar nahi bhej sakta. Main aik AI sales assistant hun aur aap ki shop par products dhoondhne aur khareedne mein madad kar sakta hun. Kya aap ko kisi product ke baare mein jan\'na hai ya koi cheez khareedni hai?', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"Mujhe afsos hai, main Khawar se tasveer le kar nahi bhej sakta. Main aik AI sales assistant hun aur aap ki shop par products dhoondhne aur khareedne mein madad kar sakta hun. Kya aap ko kisi product ke baare mein jan\'na hai ya koi cheez khareedni hai?\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 1670, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 69, \"totalTokenCount\": 1824, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 1660, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 1670}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 1660}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 85, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"qUBNavGDEZ-VnsEPmLoM\"}', '2026-07-07 18:08:42'),
(116, 81, 'Want to talk you agent', 'I understand you\'d like to speak with an agent. I\'m an AI-powered sales assistant designed to help you find products, answer questions about them, and assist with your purchases.\n\nWhile I can\'t connect you to a human agent directly, I\'m here to help you with anything related to our products and your shopping experience! Is there something specific I can help you with right now? 😊', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"I understand you\'d like to speak with an agent. I\'m an AI-powered sales assistant designed to help you find products, answer questions about them, and assist with your purchases.\\n\\nWhile I can\'t connect you to a human agent directly, I\'m here to help you with anything related to our products and your shopping experience! Is there something specific I can help you with right now? \\ud83d\\ude0a\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 1825, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 84, \"totalTokenCount\": 1971, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 1660, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 1825}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 1660}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 62, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"rkBNaviTFPSCvdIPouPRwA8\"}', '2026-07-07 18:08:47'),
(117, 82, '🤳', 'Mujhe maaf kijiye, main tasveeren nahi le sakta aur na hi bhej sakta hun. Main sirf aapki products dhoondhne aur khareedne mein madad kar sakta hun. Kya main aapko kisi product ke baare mein bata sakta hun ya aapko shopping mein koi madad chahiye?', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"Mujhe maaf kijiye, main tasveeren nahi le sakta aur na hi bhej sakta hun. Main sirf aapki products dhoondhne aur khareedne mein madad kar sakta hun. Kya main aapko kisi product ke baare mein bata sakta hun ya aapko shopping mein koi madad chahiye?\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 1742, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 64, \"totalTokenCount\": 1898, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 1660, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 1742}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 1660}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 92, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"uUBNaqTmHrCYkdUPg5ORgAE\"}', '2026-07-07 18:08:58'),
