n benefit your team in building the future of AI-powered business automation. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nRaheel Shehzad', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"{\\n\\\"is_job\\\": true,\\n\\\"job_title\\\": \\\"AI Automation & Full Stack Developer\\\",\\n\\\"company_name\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n\\\"apply_email\\\": \\\"raheelsubscriptions@gmail.com\\\",\\n\\\"apply_whatsapp\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n\\\"apply_link\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n\\\"subject\\\": \\\"Application \\u2013 AI Automation & Full Stack Developer\\\",\\n\\\"body\\\": \\\"Dear Hiring Team,\\\\n\\\\nI am writing to express my keen interest in the AI Automation & Full Stack Developer (Remote) position, as advertised. With a strong background in PHP (Laravel/CodeIgniter), Python development, JavaScript/jQuery, and MySQL, I am confident in my ability to contribute to your innovative AI automation products.\\\\n\\\\nMy experience includes working with REST APIs, Git/GitHub, and I have a solid understanding of problem-solving and writing clean code. I am particularly excited about the opportunity to build AI Chatbots, develop WhatsApp & Facebook Automation, and work on CRM/ERP/SaaS platforms, aligning perfectly with my skills and career aspirations.\\\\n\\\\nI am eager to learn more about this long-term opportunity and how my expertise can benefit your team in building the future of AI-powered business automation. Thank you for your time and consideration.\\\\n\\\\nSincerely,\\\\nRaheel Shehzad\\\"\\n}\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 713, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 274, \"totalTokenCount\": 1285, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 713}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 298, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"ewpaas76K4DmxN8Pw7-_oAg\"}', '2026-07-17 10:57:02'),
