h experience in Git & GitHub, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\\\\n\\\\nI am particularly excited about the opportunity to work on cutting-edge AI automation products, including building AI Chatbots, developing WhatsApp & Facebook Automation, and creating CRM/ERP/SaaS platforms. My skills align well with the requirements, and I am eager to apply my problem-solving abilities to develop clean and efficient code.\\\\n\\\\nThank you for considering my application. I have attached my CV and portfolio for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how my skills and experience can benefit your innovative projects.\\\\n\\\\nSincerely,\\\\nRaheel shehzad\\\"\\n}\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 713, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 273, \"totalTokenCount\": 1257, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 713}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 271, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"bAxaap-nC8fzxN8PgYzq2Ak\"}', '2026-07-17 11:05:28'),
