(1134, 370, 'Nahi', 'ٹھیک ہے، ایکسٹرا چیز کے بغیر۔ ادائیگی کا طریقہ کیا ہوگا؟ ہمارے پاس کیش، کارڈ، جاز کیش اور ایزی پیسہ دستیاب ہے۔', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"{\\n \\\"type\\\": \\\"message\\\",\\n \\\"message\\\": \\\"\\u0679\\u06be\\u06cc\\u06a9 \\u06c1\\u06d2\\u060c \\u0627\\u06cc\\u06a9\\u0633\\u0679\\u0631\\u0627 \\u0686\\u06cc\\u0632 \\u06a9\\u06d2 \\u0628\\u063a\\u06cc\\u0631\\u06d4 \\u0627\\u062f\\u0627\\u0626\\u06cc\\u06af\\u06cc \\u06a9\\u0627 \\u0637\\u0631\\u06cc\\u0642\\u06c1 \\u06a9\\u06cc\\u0627 \\u06c1\\u0648\\u06af\\u0627\\u061f \\u06c1\\u0645\\u0627\\u0631\\u06d2 \\u067e\\u0627\\u0633 \\u06a9\\u06cc\\u0634\\u060c \\u06a9\\u0627\\u0631\\u0688\\u060c \\u062c\\u0627\\u0632 \\u06a9\\u06cc\\u0634 \\u0627\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0627\\u06cc\\u0632\\u06cc \\u067e\\u06cc\\u0633\\u06c1 \\u062f\\u0633\\u062a\\u06cc\\u0627\\u0628 \\u06c1\\u06d2\\u06d4\\\"\\n}\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 6301, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 50, \"totalTokenCount\": 6429, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 5403, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 6301}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 5403}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 78, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"_MpcarWkEtGinsEPyojZ0QE\"}', '2026-07-19 13:02:51'),
(1135, 370, 'Cash', 'بہت اچھے! تو آپ کا آرڈر ہے:\n* 1 سمال چکن فجیتا پیزا\n* 1 زنگر برگر\n* 1 پیپسی (330ml)\n\nڈیلیوری ہوگی اور ادائیگی کیش میں ہوگی۔ کیا یہ آرڈر صحیح ہے اور کیا آپ اس کی تصدیق کرنا چاہیں گے؟ براہ کرم اپنا نام اور فون نمبر بھی بتائیں تاکہ میں آرڈر پلیس کر سکوں۔', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"{\\n \\\"type\\\": \\\"message\\\",\\n \\\"message\\\": \\\"\\u0628\\u06c1\\u062a \\u0627\\u0686\\u06be\\u06d2! \\u062a\\u0648 \\u0622\\u067e \\u06a9\\u0627 \\u0622\\u0631\\u0688\\u0631 \\u06c1\\u06d2:\\\\n* 1 \\u0633\\u0645\\u0627\\u0644 \\u0686\\u06a9\\u0646 \\u0641\\u062c\\u06cc\\u062a\\u0627 \\u067e\\u06cc\\u0632\\u0627\\\\n* 1 \\u0632\\u0646\\u06af\\u0631 \\u0628\\u0631\\u06af\\u0631\\\\n* 1 \\u067e\\u06cc\\u067e\\u0633\\u06cc (330ml)\\\\n\\\\n\\u0688\\u06cc\\u0644\\u06cc\\u0648\\u0631\\u06cc \\u06c1\\u0648\\u06af\\u06cc \\u0627\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0627\\u062f\\u0627\\u0626\\u06cc\\u06af\\u06cc \\u06a9\\u06cc\\u0634 \\u0645\\u06cc\\u06ba \\u06c1\\u0648\\u06af\\u06cc\\u06d4 \\u06a9\\u06cc\\u0627 \\u06cc\\u06c1 \\u0622\\u0631\\u0688\\u0631 \\u0635\\u062d\\u06cc\\u062d \\u06c1\\u06d2 \\u0627\\u0648\\u0631 \\u06a9\\u06cc\\u0627 \\u0622\\u067e \\u0627\\u0633 \\u06a9\\u06cc \\u062a\\u0635\\u062f\\u06cc\\u0642 \\u06a9\\u0631\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0686\\u0627\\u06c1\\u06cc\\u06ba \\u06af\\u06d2\\u061f \\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u06c1 \\u06a9\\u0631\\u0645 \\u0627\\u067e\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0646\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0641\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0646\\u0645\\u0628\\u0631 \\u0628\\u06be\\u06cc \\u0628\\u062a\\u0627\\u0626\\u06cc\\u06ba \\u062a\\u0627\\u06a9\\u06c1 \\u0645\\u06cc\\u06ba \\u0622\\u0631\\u0688\\u0631 \\u067e\\u0644\\u06cc\\u0633 \\u06a9\\u0631 \\u0633\\u06a9\\u0648\\u06ba\\u06d4\\\"\\n}\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 6338, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 120, \"totalTokenCount\": 6545, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 5403, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 6338}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 5403}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 87, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"CstcatfABrzjnsEP0sOniQI\"}', '2026-07-19 13:03:05'),
(1136, 370, 'Bill bta den Kitna hia', 'بل بتانے کے لیے، مجھے آپ کا ڈیلیوری ایڈریس، نام اور فون نمبر درکار ہے۔ براہ کرم یہ معلومات فراہم کریں۔', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"{\\n \\\"type\\\": \\\"message\\\",\\n \\\"message\\\": \\\"\\u0628\\u0644 \\u0628\\u062a\\u0627\\u0646\\u06d2 \\u06a9\\u06d2 \\u0644\\u06cc\\u06d2\\u060c \\u0645\\u062c\\u06be\\u06d2 \\u0622\\u067e \\u06a9\\u0627 \\u0688\\u06cc\\u0644\\u06cc\\u0648\\u0631\\u06cc \\u0627\\u06cc\\u0688\\u0631\\u06cc\\u0633\\u060c \\u0646\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0641\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0646\\u0645\\u0628\\u0631 \\u062f\\u0631\\u06a9\\u0627\\u0631 \\u06c1\\u06d2\\u06d4 \\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u06c1 \\u06a9\\u0631\\u0645 \\u06cc\\u06c1 \\u0645\\u0639\\u0644\\u0648\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0641\\u0631\\u0627\\u06c1\\u0645 \\u06a9\\u0631\\u06cc\\u06ba\\u06d4\\\"\\n}\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 6447, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 45, \"totalTokenCount\": 7129, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 5403, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 6447}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 5403}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 637, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"EMtcarKUFL--vdIPppH2oAE\"}', '2026-07-19 13:03:14'),
(1137, 370, 'Hua*', 'جی، ٹھیک ہے۔ بل بتانے کے لیے، براہ کرم مجھے اپنا نام اور فون نمبر بتا دیں۔', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"{\\n \\\"type\\\": \\\"message\\\",\\n \\\"message\\\": \\\"\\u062c\\u06cc\\u060c \\u0679\\u06be\\u06cc\\u06a9 \\u06c1\\u06d2\\u06d4 \\u0628\\u0644 \\u0628\\u062a\\u0627\\u0646\\u06d2 \\u06a9\\u06d2 \\u0644\\u06cc\\u06d2\\u060c \\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u06c1 \\u06a9\\u0631\\u0645 \\u0645\\u062c\\u06be\\u06d2 \\u0627\\u067e\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0646\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0641\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0646\\u0645\\u0628\\u0631 \\u0628\\u062a\\u0627 \\u062f\\u06cc\\u06ba\\u06d4\\\"\\n}\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 6480, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 38, \"totalTokenCount\": 6615, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 5403, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 6480}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 5403}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 97, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"FstcarDzBrL5nsEPqaicyAY\"}', '2026-07-19 13:03:17'),
(1138, 370, '03006155770', 'شکریہ، آپ کا فون نمبر نوٹ کر لیا گیا ہے۔ براہ کرم اپنا نام اور مکمل ڈیلیوری ایڈریس بھی بتائیں تاکہ میں آپ کا بل بتا سکوں۔', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"{\\n \\\"type\\\": \\\"message\\\",\\n \\\"message\\\": \\\"\\u0634\\u06a9\\u0631\\u06cc\\u06c1\\u060c \\u0622\\u067e \\u06a9\\u0627 \\u0641\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0646\\u0645\\u0628\\u0631 \\u0646\\u0648\\u0679 \\u06a9\\u0631 \\u0644\\u06cc\\u0627 \\u06af\\u06cc\\u0627 \\u06c1\\u06d2\\u06d4 \\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u06c1 \\u06a9\\u0631\\u0645 \\u0627\\u067e\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0646\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0645\\u06a9\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0688\\u06cc\\u0644\\u06cc\\u0648\\u0631\\u06cc \\u0627\\u06cc\\u0688\\u0631\\u06cc\\u0633 \\u0628\\u06be\\u06cc \\u0628\\u062a\\u0627\\u0626\\u06cc\\u06ba \\u062a\\u0627\\u06a9\\u06c1 \\u0645\\u06cc\\u06ba \\u0622\\u067e \\u06a9\\u0627 \\u0628\\u0644 \\u0628\\u062a\\u0627 \\u0633\\u06a9\\u0648\\u06ba\\u06d4\\\"\\n}\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 6515, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 52, \"totalTokenCount\": 6683, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 5403, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 6515}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 5403}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 116, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"IMtcarmxKv7hxN8PsYmkqQI\"}', '2026-07-19 13:03:30'),
(1139, 370, 'Ali', 'شکریہ علی! اب مجھے آپ کا مکمل ڈیلیوری ایڈریس درکار ہے تاکہ میں آپ کا آرڈر پلیس کر سکوں اور آپ کو کل بل بتا سکوں۔', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"message\\\", \\\"message\\\": \\\"\\u0634\\u06a9\\u0631\\u06cc\\u06c1 \\u0639\\u0644\\u06cc! \\u0627\\u0628 \\u0645\\u062c\\u06be\\u06d2 \\u0622\\u067e \\u06a9\\u0627 \\u0645\\u06a9\\u0645\\u0644 \\u0688\\u06cc\\u0644\\u06cc\\u0648\\u0631\\u06cc \\u0627\\u06cc\\u0688\\u0631\\u06cc\\u0633 \\u062f\\u0631\\u06a9\\u0627\\u0631 \\u06c1\\u06d2 \\u062a\\u0627\\u06a9\\u06c1 \\u0645\\u06cc\\u06ba \\u0622\\u067e \\u06a9\\u0627 \\u0622\\u0631\\u0688\\u0631 \\u067e\\u0644\\u06cc\\u0633 \\u06a9\\u0631 \\u0633\\u06a9\\u0648\\u06ba \\u0627\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0622\\u067e \\u06a9\\u0648 \\u06a9\\u0644 \\u0628\\u0644 \\u0628\\u062a\\u0627 \\u0633\\u06a9\\u0648\\u06ba\\u06d4\\\"}\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 6554, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 48, \"totalTokenCount\": 6675, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 5403, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 6554}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 5403}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 73, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"Kstcavr6C62o28oP4qKvwQE\"}', '2026-07-19 13:03:37'),
(1140, 370, 'Royal shinwari family restaurant', 'معذرت، لیکن مجھے ڈیلیوری کے لیے صحیح پتہ درکار ہے، جیسے کہ گلی نمبر اور علاقہ وغیرہ۔ رائل شنواری فیملی ریسٹورنٹ ہمارا پتہ نہیں ہے۔', '{\"candidates\": [{\"content\": {\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"{\\n \\\"type\\\": \\\"message\\\",\\n \\\"message\\\": \\\"\\u0645\\u0639\\u0630\\u0631\\u062a\\u060c \\u0644\\u06cc\\u06a9\\u0646 \\u0645\\u062c\\u06be\\u06d2 \\u0688\\u06cc\\u0644\\u06cc\\u0648\\u0631\\u06cc \\u06a9\\u06d2 \\u0644\\u06cc\\u06d2 \\u0635\\u062d\\u06cc\\u062d \\u067e\\u062a\\u06c1 \\u062f\\u0631\\u06a9\\u0627\\u0631 \\u06c1\\u06d2\\u060c \\u062c\\u06cc\\u0633\\u06d2 \\u06a9\\u06c1 \\u06af\\u0644\\u06cc \\u0646\\u0645\\u0628\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0627\\u0642\\u06c1 \\u0648\\u063a\\u06cc\\u0631\\u06c1\\u06d4 \\u0631\\u0627\\u0626\\u0644 \\u0634\\u0646\\u0648\\u0627\\u0631\\u06cc \\u0641\\u06cc\\u0645\\u0644\\u06cc \\u0631\\u06cc\\u0633\\u0679\\u0648\\u0631\\u0646\\u0679 \\u06c1\\u0645\\u0627\\u0631\\u0627 \\u067e\\u062a\\u06c1 \\u0646\\u06c1\\u06cc\\u06ba \\u06c1\\u06d2\\u06d4\\\"\\n}\"}], \"role\": \"model\"}, \"finishReason\": \"STOP\", \"index\": 0}], \"usageMetadata\": {\"promptTokenCount\": 6598, \"candidatesTokenCount\": 58, \"totalTokenCount\": 6714, \"cachedContentTokenCount\": 5403, \"promptTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 6598}], \"cacheTokensDetails\": [{\"modality\": \"TEXT\", \"tokenCount\": 5403}], \"thoughtsTokenCount\": 58, \"serviceTier\": \"standard\"}, \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-2.5-flash\", \"responseId\": \"QctcapW_D7mSkdUP4-3hwQE\"}', '2026-07-19 13:04:01');
INSERT INTO `job_posting` (`id`, `user_id`, `company_email`, `subject`, `body`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES
(9, 6, 'raheelshehzad188@gmail.com', 'Application for Senior PHP/Laravel Developer - Raheel Shehzad', 'Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am writing to express my enthusiastic interest in the Senior PHP/Laravel Developer position at TechNova Solutions, as advertised. With 3+ years of experience in PHP and Laravel development, I am confident in my ability to contribute significantly to your team.\n\nMy expertise includes developing and maintaining PHP/Laravel applications, designing and integrating RESTful APIs, optimizing application performance, and working with MySQL and Git/GitHub. I am proficient in writing clean, maintainable, and well-documented code.\n\nI am eager to learn more about this opportunity and discuss how my skills and experience align with your requirements.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nRaheel Shehzad', 1, '2026-07-07 17:48:06'),
(10, 6, 'khurrammumtazabbasi@gmail.com', 'Application for Senior PHP/Laravel Developer (Remote) - Raheel Shehzad', 'Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am writing to express my keen interest in the Senior PHP/Laravel Developer (Remote) position at TechNova Solutions, as advertised. With 3+ years of experience in PHP and Laravel development, I possess a strong background in building and maintaining scalable web applications, designing RESTful APIs, and optimizing database performance.\n\nMy expertise includes MySQL, Git/GitHub, and a solid understanding of frontend technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and jQuery. I am adept at troubleshooting and deploying production-ready solutions, and I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\n\nI am particularly drawn to this role by the opportunity to work remotely and leverage my skills in a dynamic environment. My attached CV provides further details on my qualifications and experience.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you soon.\n\nSincerely,\nRaheel Shehzad', 1, '2026-07-07 17:50:29'),
(11, 6, 'khurrammumtazabbasi@gmail.com', 'Senior PHP/Laravel Developer Application - Raheel Shehzad', 'Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am writing to express my keen interest in the Senior PHP/Laravel Developer position at TechNova Solutions, as advertised. With over 3 years of experience in PHP and Laravel development, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\n\nMy expertise includes developing and maintaining PHP/Laravel applications, designing and integrating RESTful APIs, optimizing application performance, and working with MySQL databases. I am also proficient with Git/GitHub and have a good understanding of front-end technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and jQuery. I am adept at writing clean, maintainable, and well-documented code.\n\nI am excited about the opportunity to join a growing development team and apply my skills to build scalable web applications. My CV is attached for your review, which provides further details on my qualifications and experience.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you soon.\n\nSincerely,\nRaheel Shehzad', 1, '2026-07-07 17:57:21'),
(12, 6, 'raheelshehzad188@gmail.com', 'Application for Senior Laravel Developer - Raheel Shehzad', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am applying for the Senior Laravel Developer role.\n\nBest regards,\nRaheel Shehzad', 1, '2026-07-17 11:01:50'),
(13, 6, 'raheelshehzad188@gmail.com', 'Application for PHP Developer - Raheel Shehzad', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nPlease find my CV attached.\n\nRegards,\nRaheel', 1, '2026-07-17 11:03:56'),
(14, 15, 'raheelsubscriptions@gmail.com', 'Application – AI Automation & Full Stack Developer', 'Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am writing to express my keen interest in the AI Automation & Full Stack Developer position, as advertised. With a strong background in PHP (Laravel/CodeIgniter), Python, JavaScript, MySQL, and REST APIs, coupled with experience in Git & GitHub, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\n\nI am particularly excited about the opportunity to work on cutting-edge AI automation products, including building AI Chatbots, developing WhatsApp & Facebook Automation, and creating CRM/ERP/SaaS platforms. My skills align well with the requirements, and I am eager to apply my problem-solving abilities to develop clean and efficient code.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I have attached my CV and portfolio for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how my skills and experience can benefit your innovative projects.\n\nSincerely,\nRaheel shehzad', 1, '2026-07-17 11:05:28');
