(12, 'AED', '2026-07-17 09:09:06', '2026-07-17 09:09:06', 'CleanAir', 'Cleaning Services', 'CleanAir is a professional cleaning company based in Business Bay, Dubai. We provide home, villa, office, AC, and specialised deep-cleaning services across Dubai with trained crews and eco-friendly products.', 'Business Bay, Dubai, UAE', 'Dubai', '+971 50 123 4567', 'service@test.com', 'Visitor parking available at most buildings; crews carry their own equipment.', 'Cash, Card, Stripe, Online Payment, Bank Transfer', 'Free cancellation up to 4 hours before the scheduled slot.', 'Working hours Monday to Saturday, 08:00 AM - 08:00 PM. Closed Sunday.', 'https://cleanair.ae', 'https://maps.google.com/?q=Business+Bay+Dubai', 'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Clean+Air&background=0ea5e9&color=fff&size=256', '#0ea5e9', '#2563eb', '#10b981', '#f8fbff', 'Ahmed Hassan', 'United Arab Emirates', 'Asia/Dubai', 'Service', '+971 50 123 4567', 5.00),
