)\n  - id=37 | Special Pizza [Pizza]: 2200.0 PKR, prep=20 min, FEATURED. House special loaded. Variations: Small (-200.0); Medium (+0.0); Large (+400.0)\n  - id=38 | Zinger Burger [Burger]: 650.0 PKR, prep=10 min, FEATURED. Crispy chicken fillet\n  - id=39 | Beef Burger [Burger]: 750.0 PKR, prep=10 min. Grilled beef patty\n  - id=40 | Double Patty [Burger]: 950.0 PKR, prep=10 min. Double beef patty\n  - id=41 | Regular Fries [Fries]: 250.0 PKR, prep=10 min. Classic salted fries\n  - id=42 | Loaded Fries [Fries]: 550.0 PKR, prep=10 min. Fries with cheese & sauce\n  - id=43 | Pepsi [Drinks]: 150.0 PKR, prep=10 min. 330ml\n  - id=44 | 7UP [Drinks]: 150.0 PKR, prep=10 min. 330ml\n  - id=45 | Mountain Dew [Drinks]: 150.0 PKR, prep=10 min. 330ml\n  - id=46 | Mineral Water [Drinks]: 100.0 PKR, prep=10 min. 500ml\n  - id=47 | Brownie [Desserts]: 350.0 PKR, prep=10 min. Chocolate fudge brownie\n  - id=48 | Ice Cream [Desserts]: 300.0 PKR, prep=10 min. Vanilla scoop\n## Add-ons\n  - Extra Cheese: 200.0 PKR\n  - Extra Chicken: 350.0 PKR\n  - Olives: 150.0 PKR\n  - Mushrooms: 180.0 PKR\n  - Extra Sauce: 100.0 PKR\n## Combo Deals\n  - Family Deal: 3999.0 PKR — 2 Large Pizzas, 2 Drinks\n## Promotions\n  - 20% Off Family Deal: 20% — Get 20% off the Family Deal combo.\n  - Buy 2 Get 1 Drink Free: Free Drink — Order any 2 pizzas and get a free drink.\n## Payment Methods\n  - Cash: Pay cash on delivery / pickup\n  - Card: Debit / credit card\n  - JazzCash: Mobile wallet\n  - EasyPaisa: Mobile wallet\n## FAQs\n  - Q: What are your delivery charges? | A: Delivery charges are 250 PKR.\n  - Q: What is the minimum order? | A: Minimum order is 500 PKR.\n  - Q: How long does delivery take? | A: Estimated delivery is 30-45 minutes.\n  - Q: Which payment methods do you accept? | A: Cash, Card, JazzCash and EasyPaisa.\n  - Q: Do you offer pickup? | A: Yes, you can choose pickup at checkout with no delivery charge.\n## Working Hours\n  - Mon: 10:00:00 to 23:00:00\n  - Tue: 10:00:00 to 23:00:00\