(3, 6, '26341118357595@lid', ']# Senior PHP / Laravel Developer (Remote)\n\n**Company:** TechNova Solutions\n**Location:** Remote (Worldwide)\n**Job Type:** Full-Time\n**Experience:** 3+ Years\n\n## About the Role\n\nWe are looking for an experienced PHP/Laravel Developer to join our growing development team. The ideal candidate should have strong backend development skills, experience with REST APIs, and the ability to build scalable web applications.\n\n## Responsibilities\n\n* Develop and maintain PHP/Laravel applications.\n* Design and integrate RESTful APIs.\n* Optimize application performance and database queries.\n* Collaborate with frontend developers and UI/UX designers.\n* Write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code.\n* Troubleshoot bugs and deploy production-ready solutions.\n\n## Requirements\n\n* 3+ years of experience with PHP and Laravel.\n* Strong knowledge of MySQL.\n* Experience with Git/GitHub.\n* Good understanding of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and jQuery.\n* Experience with API integrations.\n* Familiarity with AWS or DigitalOcean is a plus.\n* Excellent problem-solving and communication skills.\n\n## Preferred Skills\n\n* Vue.js or React\n* Docker\n* Redis\n* CI/CD Pipelines\n\n## Salary\n\nUSD $2,500 – $4,000 per month (Based on experience)\n\n## How to Apply\n\nSend your updated CV with the subject **\"Senior PHP/Laravel Developer Application\"** to:\n\n**[raheelshehzad188@gmail.com](mailto:raheelshehzad188@gmail.com)**\n\nOnly shortlisted candidates will be contacted.', '{\"event\": \"message_received\", \"session\": \"user_6\", \"phone\": \"26341118357595@lid\", \"sender_phone\": \"26341118357595@lid\", \"message\": \"]# Senior PHP / Laravel Developer (Remote)\\n\\n**Company:** TechNova Solutions\\n**Location:** Remote (Worldwide)\\n**Job Type:** Full-Time\\n**Experience:** 3+ Years\\n\\n## About the Role\\n\\nWe are looking for an experienced PHP/Laravel Developer to join our growing development team. The ideal candidate should have strong backend development skills, experience with REST APIs, and the ability to build scalable web applications.\\n\\n## Responsibilities\\n\\n* Develop and maintain PHP/Laravel applications.\\n* Design and integrate RESTful APIs.\\n* Optimize application performance and database queries.\\n* Collaborate with frontend developers and UI/UX designers.\\n* Write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code.\\n* Troubleshoot bugs and deploy production-ready solutions.\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\n* 3+ years of experience with PHP and Laravel.\\n* Strong knowledge of MySQL.\\n* Experience with Git/GitHub.\\n* Good understanding of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and jQuery.\\n* Experience with API integrations.\\n* Familiarity with AWS or DigitalOcean is a plus.\\n* Excellent problem-solving and communication skills.\\n\\n## Preferred Skills\\n\\n* Vue.js or React\\n* Docker\\n* Redis\\n* CI/CD Pipelines\\n\\n## Salary\\n\\nUSD $2,500 – $4,000 per month (Based on experience)\\n\\n## How to Apply\\n\\nSend your updated CV with the subject **\\\"Senior PHP/Laravel Developer Application\\\"** to:\\n\\n**[raheelshehzad188@gmail.com](mailto:raheelshehzad188@gmail.com)**\\n\\nOnly shortlisted candidates will be contacted.\", \"text\": \"]# Senior PHP / Laravel Developer (Remote)\\n\\n**Company:** TechNova Solutions\\n**Location:** Remote (Worldwide)\\n**Job Type:** Full-Time\\n**Experience:** 3+ Years\\n\\n## About the Role\\n\\nWe are looking for an experienced PHP/Laravel Developer to join our growing development team. The ideal candidate should have strong backend development skills, experience with REST APIs, and the ability to build scalable web applications.\\n\\n## Responsibilities\\n\\n* Develop and maintain PHP/Laravel applications.\\n* Design and integrate RESTful APIs.\\n* Optimize application performance and database queries.\\n* Collaborate with frontend developers and UI/UX designers.\\n* Write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code.\\n* Troubleshoot bugs and deploy production-ready solutions.\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\n* 3+ years of experience with PHP and Laravel.\\n* Strong knowledge of MySQL.\\n* Experience with Git/GitHub.\\n* Good understanding of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and jQuery.\\n* Experience with API integrations.\\n* Familiarity with AWS or DigitalOcean is a plus.\\n* Excellent problem-solving and communication skills.\\n\\n## Preferred Skills\\n\\n* Vue.js or React\\n* Docker\\n* Redis\\n* CI/CD Pipelines\\n\\n## Salary\\n\\nUSD $2,500 – $4,000 per month (Based on experience)\\n\\n## How to Apply\\n\\nSend your updated CV with the subject **\\\"Senior PHP/Laravel Developer Application\\\"** to:\\n\\n**[raheelshehzad188@gmail.com](mailto:raheelshehzad188@gmail.com)**\\n\\nOnly shortlisted candidates will be contacted.\", \"sender_name\": \"Raheel Shehzad\", \"name\": \"Raheel Shehzad\", \"number\": \"26341118357595@lid\", \"from\": \"26341118357595@lid\", \"wpp_event\": \"onmessage\", \"received_at\": \"2026-07-07T17:48:00+00:00\"}', 1, '923004210607', '{\"notify\": {}, \"reply\": {}, \"ai\": {\"handler_class\": \"Job_posting\", \"action_only\": true, \"success\": true, \"reply_json\": {\"is_job\": true, \"job_title\": \"Senior PHP / Laravel Developer\", \"company_name\": \"TechNova Solutions\", \"apply_email\": \"raheelshehzad188@gmail.com\", \"apply_whatsapp\": \"\", \"apply_link\": \"\", \"subject\": \"Application for Senior PHP/Laravel Developer - Raheel Shehzad\", \"body\": \"Dear Hiring Team,\\n\\nI am writing to express my enthusiastic interest in the Senior PHP/Laravel Developer position at TechNova Solutions, as advertised. With 3+ years of experience in PHP and Laravel development, I am confident in my ability to contribute significantly to your team.\\n\\nMy expertise includes developing and maintaining PHP/Laravel applications, designing and integrating RESTful APIs, optimizing application performance, and working with MySQL and Git/GitHub. I am proficient in writing clean, maintainable, and well-documented code.\\n\\nI am eager to learn more about this opportunity and discuss how my skills and experience align with your requirements.\\n\\nThank you for your time and consideration.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nRaheel Shehzad\"}}}', 'action_processed', '2026-07-07 17:48:06'),
