d deploy production-ready solutions.\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\n* 3+ years of experience with PHP and Laravel.\\n* Strong knowledge of MySQL.\\n* Experience with Git/GitHub.\\n* Good understanding of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and jQuery.\\n* Experience with API integrations.\\n* Familiarity with AWS or DigitalOcean is a plus.\\n* Excellent problem-solving and communication skills.\\n\\n## Preferred Skills\\n\\n* Vue.js or React\\n* Docker\\n* Redis\\n* CI/CD Pipelines\\n\\n## Salary\\n\\nUSD $2,500 – $4,000 per month (Based on experience)\\n\\n## How to Apply\\n\\nSend your updated CV with the subject **\\\"Senior PHP/Laravel Developer Application\\\"** to:\\n\\n**[khurrammumtazabbasi@gmail.com](mailto:khurrammumtazabbasi@gmail.com)**\\n\\nOnly shortlisted candidates will be contacted.\", \"sender_name\": \"Raheel Shehzad\", \"name\": \"Raheel Shehzad\", \"number\": \"26341118357595@lid\", \"from\": \"26341118357595@lid\", \"wpp_event\": \"onmessage\", \"received_at\": \"2026-07-07T17:57:14+00:00\"}', 1, '923004210607', '{\"notify\": {}, \"reply\": {}, \"ai\": {\"handler_class\": \"Job_posting\", \"action_only\": true, \"success\": true, \"reply_json\": {\"is_job\": true, \"job_title\": \"Senior PHP / Laravel Developer\", \"company_name\": \"TechNova Solutions\", \"apply_email\": \"khurrammumtazabbasi@gmail.com\", \"apply_whatsapp\": \"\", \"apply_link\": \"\", \"subject\": \"Senior PHP/Laravel Developer Application - Raheel Shehzad\", \"body\": \"Dear Hiring Team,\\n\\nI am writing to express my keen interest in the Senior PHP/Laravel Developer position at TechNova Solutions, as advertised. With over 3 years of experience in PHP and Laravel development, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\\n\\nMy expertise includes developing and maintaining PHP/Laravel applications, designing and integrating RESTful APIs, optimizing application performance, and working with MySQL databases. I am also proficient with Git/GitHub and have a good understanding of front-end technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and jQuery. I am adept at writing clean, maintainable, and well-documented code.\\n\\nI am excited about the opportunity to join a growing development team and apply my skills to build scalable web applications. My CV is attached for your review, which provides further details on my qualifications and experience.\\n\\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you soon.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nRaheel Shehzad\"}}}', 'action_processed', '2026-07-07 17:57:21');
