(84, 15, '22076232609947@lid', '🚀 We\'re Hiring – AI Automation & Full Stack Developer (Remote)\n\nAre you passionate about AI, automation, and building innovative software? We\'re looking for a skilled developer to join our growing team and work on cutting-edge AI automation products.\n\n💼 Position:\nAI Automation & Full Stack Developer\n\n📍 Location:\nRemote\n\n🛠 Requirements:\n• Strong PHP (Laravel / CodeIgniter)\n• Python Development\n• JavaScript / jQuery\n• MySQL\n• REST APIs\n• Git & GitHub\n• AI API Integration (OpenAI / Gemini) – Plus Point\n• Problem Solving & Clean Code\n\n⭐ Bonus Skills:\n• WordPress & WooCommerce\n• WhatsApp Cloud API\n• Facebook API\n• Docker\n• React / Angular / Ionic\n\n🎯 Responsibilities:\n• Build AI Chatbots\n• Develop WhatsApp & Facebook Automation\n• Create CRM / ERP / SaaS Platforms\n• API Integrations\n• Automation Workflows\n• AI Agent Development\n\n🎁 Benefits:\n✅ Remote Work\n✅ Flexible Hours\n✅ Long-Term Opportunity\n✅ Professional Growth\n✅ Exciting AI Projects\n✅ Competitive Salary\n\n📩 How to Apply\n\nSend your CV & Portfolio to:\n\n📧 raheelsubscriptions@gmail.com\n\nSubject:\nApplication – AI Automation & Full Stack Developer\n\nJoin us and build the future of AI-powered business automation! 🚀', '{\"event\": \"message_received\", \"session\": \"user_15\", \"phone\": \"22076232609947@lid\", \"sender_phone\": \"22076232609947@lid\", \"message\": \"🚀 We\'re Hiring – AI Automation & Full Stack Developer (Remote)\\n\\nAre you passionate about AI, automation, and building innovative software? We\'re looking for a skilled developer to join our growing team and work on cutting-edge AI automation products.\\n\\n💼 Position:\\nAI Automation & Full Stack Developer\\n\\n📍 Location:\\nRemote\\n\\n🛠 Requirements:\\n• Strong PHP (Laravel / CodeIgniter)\\n• Python Development\\n• JavaScript / jQuery\\n• MySQL\\n• REST APIs\\n• Git & GitHub\\n• AI API Integration (OpenAI / Gemini) – Plus Point\\n• Problem Solving & Clean Code\\n\\n⭐ Bonus Skills:\\n• WordPress & WooCommerce\\n• WhatsApp Cloud API\\n• Facebook API\\n• Docker\\n• React / Angular / Ionic\\n\\n🎯 Responsibilities:\\n• Build AI Chatbots\\n• Develop WhatsApp & Facebook Automation\\n• Create CRM / ERP / SaaS Platforms\\n• API Integrations\\n• Automation Workflows\\n• AI Agent Development\\n\\n🎁 Benefits:\\n✅ Remote Work\\n✅ Flexible Hours\\n✅ Long-Term Opportunity\\n✅ Professional Growth\\n✅ Exciting AI Projects\\n✅ Competitive Salary\\n\\n📩 How to Apply\\n\\nSend your CV & Portfolio to:\\n\\n📧 raheelsubscriptions@gmail.com\\n\\nSubject:\\nApplication – AI Automation & Full Stack Developer\\n\\nJoin us and build the future of AI-powered business automation! 🚀\", \"text\": \"🚀 We\'re Hiring – AI Automation & Full Stack Developer (Remote)\\n\\nAre you passionate about AI, automation, and building innovative software? We\'re looking for a skilled developer to join our growing team and work on cutting-edge AI automation products.\\n\\n💼 Position:\\nAI Automation & Full Stack Developer\\n\\n📍 Location:\\nRemote\\n\\n🛠 Requirements:\\n• Strong PHP (Laravel / CodeIgniter)\\n• Python Development\\n• JavaScript / jQuery\\n• MySQL\\n• REST APIs\\n• Git & GitHub\\n• AI API Integration (OpenAI / Gemini) – Plus Point\\n• Problem Solving & Clean Code\\n\\n⭐ Bonus Skills:\\n• WordPress & WooCommerce\\n• WhatsApp Cloud API\\n• Facebook API\\n• Docker\\n• React / Angular / Ionic\\n\\n🎯 Responsibilities:\\n• Build AI Chatbots\\n• Develop WhatsApp & Facebook Automation\\n• Create CRM / ERP / SaaS Platforms\\n• API Integrations\\n• Automation Workflows\\n• AI Agent Development\\n\\n🎁 Benefits:\\n✅ Remote Work\\n✅ Flexible Hours\\n✅ Long-Term Opportunity\\n✅ Professional Growth\\n✅ Exciting AI Projects\\n✅ Competitive Salary\\n\\n📩 How to Apply\\n\\nSend your CV & Portfolio to:\\n\\n📧 raheelsubscriptions@gmail.com\\n\\nSubject:\\nApplication – AI Automation & Full Stack Developer\\n\\nJoin us and build the future of AI-powered business automation! 🚀\", \"sender_name\": \"husain\", \"name\": \"husain\", \"number\": \"22076232609947@lid\", \"from\": \"22076232609947@lid\", \"wpp_event\": \"onmessage\", \"received_at\": \"2026-07-17T10:54:29+00:00\"}', 1, '923004210607', '{\"notify\": {}, \"reply\": {}, \"ai\": {\"handler_class\": \"Job_posting\", \"action_only\": true, \"success\": true, \"reply_json\": {\"type\": \"message\", \"message\": \"Dear Hiring Team,\\n\\nI am writing to express my keen interest in the AI Automation & Full Stack Developer position, as advertised. With a strong background in PHP (Laravel/CodeIgniter), Python, JavaScript, and MySQL, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\\n\\nMy experience includes developing automation workflows, API integrations, and working with AI API integrations, which aligns perfectly with the requirements for building AI chatbots, WhatsApp & Facebook automation, and CRM/ERP/SaaS platforms.\\n\\nI am particularly excited about the opportunity to work on cutting-edge AI automation products and contribute to the future of AI-powered business automation.\\n\\nThank you for your time and consideration. I have attached my CV and portfolio for your review and look forward to hearing from you soon.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nRaheel Shehzad\"}}}', 'action_processed', '2026-07-17 10:54:33'),
(85, 15, '22076232609947@lid', '🚀 We\'re Hiring – AI Automation & Full Stack Developer (Remote)\n\nAre you passionate about AI, automation, and building innovative software? We\'re looking for a skilled developer to join our growing team and work on cutting-edge AI automation products.\n\n💼 Position:\nAI Automation & Full Stack Developer\n\n📍 Location:\nRemote\n\n🛠 Requirements:\n• Strong PHP (Laravel / CodeIgniter)\n• Python Development\n• JavaScript / jQuery\n• MySQL\n• REST APIs\n• Git & GitHub\n• AI API Integration (OpenAI / Gemini) – Plus Point\n• Problem Solving & Clean Code\n\n⭐ Bonus Skills:\n• WordPress & WooCommerce\n• WhatsApp Cloud API\n• Facebook API\n• Docker\n• React / Angular / Ionic\n\n🎯 Responsibilities:\n• Build AI Chatbots\n• Develop WhatsApp & Facebook Automation\n• Create CRM / ERP / SaaS Platforms\n• API Integrations\n• Automation Workflows\n• AI Agent Development\n\n🎁 Benefits:\n✅ Remote Work\n✅ Flexible Hours\n✅ Long-Term Opportunity\n✅ Professional Growth\n✅ Exciting AI Projects\n✅ Competitive Salary\n\n📩 How to Apply\n\nSend your CV & Portfolio to:\n\n📧 raheelsubscriptions@gmail.com\n\nSubject:\nApplication – AI Automation & Full Stack Developer\n\nJoin us and build the future of AI-powered business automation! 🚀', '{\"event\": \"message_received\", \"session\": \"user_15\", \"phone\": \"22076232609947@lid\", \"sender_phone\": \"22076232609947@lid\", \"message\": \"🚀 We\'re Hiring – AI Automation & Full Stack Developer (Remote)\\n\\nAre you passionate about AI, automation, and building innovative software? We\'re looking for a skilled developer to join our growing team and work on cutting-edge AI automation products.\\n\\n💼 Position:\\nAI Automation & Full Stack Developer\\n\\n📍 Location:\\nRemote\\n\\n🛠 Requirements:\\n• Strong PHP (Laravel / CodeIgniter)\\n• Python Development\\n• JavaScript / jQuery\\n• MySQL\\n• REST APIs\\n• Git & GitHub\\n• AI API Integration (OpenAI / Gemini) – Plus Point\\n• Problem Solving & Clean Code\\n\\n⭐ Bonu